<title>UK: Garantia places debt for Brazil's Trikem.</title>
<headline>Garantia places debt for Brazil's Trikem.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Banco de Investimentos Garantia SA said on Wednesday it had completed a $21 million private placement of commercial paper for Brazilian plastics producer Trikem SA.</p>
<p>Garantia said in a statement released in London that its corporate finance department had placed the six-month paper last week.</p>
<p>The Sao Paulo-based plastics firm is a subsidiary of Brazil's Bahia-based congolomerate Oderbrecht and has operations in northern Brazil.</p>
<p>Trikem preferred shares closed at 3.45 reais on the Sao Paulo exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Caroline Brothers, London Newsroom +44 171 542 2734</p>
